  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-3">
    <td>Two shallow ulcers under the lower denture flange, probably traumatic from an ill-fitting denture, with no induration, red or white patch, or neck lymph node; to be re-examined two weeks after the denture is left out between meals</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>K12.1</td><td>S — Synthetic oral finding at intake; healed by the consultation, which confirmed denture-related traumatic ulcers.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-4">
    <td>Unintended weight loss of about 5.6 kg (6%) over six months from a narrowed, soft diet; at risk of malnutrition (MNA-SF 10)</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>R63.4</td><td>S — Synthetic nutrition problem linked to the documented difficulty eating with dentures.</td>
  </tr></tbody></table></text>

